1
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:43,710
The most qualified in the game,

2
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:44,300
seven years of uni,

3
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,010
which is totally useless!

4
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,660
But unheard of for a woman.

5
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,470
I don't know if you know, but the baccalaureate

6
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:52,790
was banned for girls in France until

7
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:55,390
1924. Granted, we did take

8
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:56,990
a little exam that was

9
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:59,210
reserved for our sex, a little

10
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:02,350
"mini-bac". It was…

11
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:05,100
Flower arranging for the written part…

12
00:01:05,410 --> 00:01:07,750
And "how to please your husband" for

13
00:01:07,750 --> 00:01:09,160
the oral, of course.

14
00:01:10,130 --> 00:01:11,810
As for higher education,

15
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:13,000
it's very simple.

16
00:01:13,190 --> 00:01:15,270
All the top schools are closed

17
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:16,650
to girls. All of them. We'll have to

18
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:18,650
open them one by one, like

19
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:20,930
Polytechnique, which opens to women

20
00:01:20,930 --> 00:01:23,080
in 1972.

21
00:01:23,490 --> 00:01:25,810
And even then, I can tell you in '72

22
00:01:25,810 --> 00:01:27,850
the guys hesitated, then after a

23
00:01:27,850 --> 00:01:29,320
while one of them went:

24
00:01:31,250 --> 00:01:32,720
"Fine!

25
00:01:33,410 --> 00:01:35,250
Let them sit the entrance exam,

26
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:36,910
who cares, they'll

27
00:01:36,910 --> 00:01:37,280
never pass!"

28
00:01:39,210 --> 00:01:40,320
The idiot!

29
00:01:41,830 --> 00:01:44,230
1972: 7 women get into Polytechnique.

30
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:47,030
Among them Anne Chopinet, who

31
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:49,300
finishes top of her class.

32
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:57,680
In your face! The 14th of July parade:

33
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:00,000
Anne Chopinet on the Champs-Élysées, leading

34
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,760
the Polytechnique parade, flag

35
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,710
bearer, chest out,

36
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,760
with all the other

37
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:09,900
jerks behind her, swords drooping.

38
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:11,770
Oh la la la la…

39
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:15,060
On the side, watching the parade, you've got

40
00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:16,790
all the heads of the top schools:

41
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:20,310
"Don't open the schools to women,

42
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,910
they're smarter than we thought!"

43
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,440
So I have a theory: I think

44
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:28,340
it's because of Anne Chopinet that

45
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:31,540
the Naval Academy takes 20 more years

46
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:33,610
to open its doors to us.

47
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:35,350
Yes, Marrakech, you're quick at maths:

48
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,230
72 plus 20,

49
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,230
1992,

50
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:42,790
the Naval Academy opens to women.

51
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:45,920
They were so scared we'd be

52
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:48,940
better! Aren't you a bit short of

53
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:50,410
balls, you sailors?

54
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:52,540
Well, maybe that's why they

55
00:02:52,540 --> 00:02:53,930
stuck one on the beret.

56
00:02:56,930 --> 00:02:59,070
Me, I graduated from the

57
00:02:59,070 --> 00:03:00,960
Paris Bar school.

58
00:03:01,290 --> 00:03:03,380
So yes, I really was a lawyer.

59
00:03:03,730 --> 00:03:05,690
I mean, yes, I really defended

60
00:03:05,690 --> 00:03:08,550
people who are all still

61
00:03:08,550 --> 00:03:09,200
in prison today.

62
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:11,990
And tonight I'm thinking

63
00:03:11,990 --> 00:03:13,520
especially of my former clients.

64
00:03:13,550 --> 00:03:15,040
Picture the guy in his cell.

65
00:03:15,070 --> 00:03:17,050
He turns on his TV to watch

66
00:03:17,050 --> 00:03:19,390
the Marrakech du Rire, and he sees me

67
00:03:19,390 --> 00:03:20,320
doing a comedy sketch.

68
00:03:22,980 --> 00:03:25,360
Now the guy starts to understand why

69
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,710
he got 13 years

70
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:30,310
for stealing a scooter.
